A '''Festering Maggot''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's {{Stat|def}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Festering Maggot''' has a {{Chance|0.5%|1|200}} chance to drop from a {{SlayerTier|4}} or above {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} once at {{Coll|Zombie Slayer VI}}.

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Festering Maggot''' grants {{SBXP|+2}} and a permanent {{stat|def|+1}}. Up to {{Green|5}} '''Festering Maggots''' can be consumed in total.

